      <span class="story__chip">Our story</span>
      <h2 class="story__title">From <em>real wagyu,</em> a real bowl.</h2>

      <div class="story__body">
        <p>Our family started as wagyu merchants in <em>1962</em>. Five generations of facing cattle, judging meat, and refining the same craft — wholesale, butcher, restaurant.</p>
        <p>In my thirties, I visited America, and the "WAGYU" I saw there shocked me. Australian and American cattle being sold as wagyu, people smiling, saying "<em>so this is wagyu?</em>" — and what they ate wasn't the real thing.</p>
        <p>As the fifth generation, I made a decision: <em>deliver real wagyu to the world again</em>. Not the over-fattened industrial cuts. <em>Healthy lean wagyu</em> with deep umami in the meat itself. That's the wagyu in this bowl.</p>
        <p>And <em>{{ store.city }}</em> — at the heart of Japan's food culture — is where we serve it as ramen. Walk in, and into this bowl. <em>Halal-friendly</em>, made for travelers who came to Japan for the real thing.</p>
        <p class="story__quote">
          "Real wagyu, for everyone in the world."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

